ibold text-ink mb-4\">Benchmarks</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R23</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">13,531</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">87<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">757</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">1,787</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">87<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Cinebench R24</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 flex-wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Multi core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">808</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">85<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">cpu_ratio</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">732</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">110</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">85<!-- -->w</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">3,884</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">154.2</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">85w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,853</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">73.5</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">85w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">720p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">2,550</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">42.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">68w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">1,499</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">24.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">68w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">The V26 is a tight APU-only case without discrete graphics card support. Assembly was easier than the V40 due to lack of a dedicated GPU, though mounting the power module with the 50mm fan on the bottom is challenging. The 8600G delivers impressive 15-20% performance improvement over the previous 5700G generation. The Radeon 760M graphics are not as capable as the 8700G or GTX 1050ti, but gaming FPS performance is comparable to GTX 1650. The 6-core/12-thread configuration excels in low-power applications like HTPC builds, drawing no more than 87W under stress testing. Temperatures reached 95C junction but never throttled in this compact package. The 225W PICO power supply configuration is uncommon in US systems and carries electrocution risks. Overall, this is a solid, tight build well-suited for APU-based ultra-small form factor projects.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">13,531</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\" style=\"width:42%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->58<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">155.5</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-sff-red\">0<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">73.5<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-amber\" style=\"width:25%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->75<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">0.86</span> fps/w</span></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface mt-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-10\"><div class=\"max-w-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-3\"><div class=\"h-6 w-6 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[10px] font-bold\">CW</div><span class=\"font-semibold text-ink text-sm\">ComponentWatch</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed\">Real-time PC component price tracking and community-verified SFF build data.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-14 text-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint\">Prices</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/compare\">Compare</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/ai-builds\">AI Builds</a></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink-faint\">Community</p><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/builds\">Builds</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/cases\">Cases</a><a class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" href=\"/submit\">Submit a build</a><a href=\"https://reddit.com/r/sffpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">r/sffpc ↗</a></div></div></div><div cla